					</Point>
				</Placemark>
				<Placemark id="5DB74C1288000037">
					<name>National Library of Latvia</name>
					<description><![CDATA[<div>The National Library of Latvia, also known as the Castle of Light, resembles a "glass mountain" from Latvian folklore.</div><div>The building holds Latvia’s stories, books and knowledge – and offers a great view back towards Riga.</div>]]></description>
					<LookAt>
